    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your own worst enemy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kicked out of therapy, blood on your hands, and nowhere to run. Shotgun Recovery offers a dark single-player campaign about mental struggle. Fight a variety of terrible monsters as you jump between nightmare and reality in 10 varied levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283090/extras/777113923c7952d83c64638049009b99.avif?t=1746197966\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage your mind</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your head is as important as your ammo. When the dust settles; take a moment for self-care. Grab a bite to eat, pop some pills, or take a shower. For when nightmares come alive, preparedness can be the difference between waking up in a cold sweat \u2014 and not waking up at all. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283090/extras/998234d1a4dde6f3de89ab538384a3b2.avif?t=1746197966\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reactive sanity system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a dozen enemy types, including boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of linear and open levels with secrets to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable Horde Mode</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your own worst enemy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kicked out of therapy, blood on your hands, and nowhere to run. Shotgun Recovery offers a dark single-player campaign about mental struggle. Fight a variety of terrible monsters as you jump between nightmare and reality in 10 varied levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283090/extras/777113923c7952d83c64638049009b99.avif?t=1746197966\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage your mind</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your head is as important as your ammo. When the dust settles; take a moment for self-care. Grab a bite to eat, pop some pills, or take a shower. For when nightmares come alive, preparedness can be the difference between waking up in a cold sweat \u2014 and not waking up at all. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283090/extras/998234d1a4dde6f3de89ab538384a3b2.avif?t=1746197966\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reactive sanity system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a dozen enemy types, including boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of linear and open levels with secrets to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable Horde Mode</p></li></ul>",
